        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ribbon made of silk chiné 'Velours au Sabre' decoration. With image of a small 'island' of grass against a background of flowering plants in shades of pink, green-grey and some pale yellow on a white ground. Standing on the 'island' are two exotic birds, one with pink legs and blue tail-feathers, the other with buff coloured legs and pink tail-feathers. Other colours used are shades of brown, yellow, black and green-grey. Part of the design is in simple silk chiné satin, but in places the satin has been cut to form a pile, thus giving depth to the design."@en , "Velours sabre ribbon, possibly Lyon or St. Étienne, France, 1890-99."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/37e0669a-c993-3bbe-8758-1d2a15e72f4d> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Velours sabre ribbon, possibly Lyon or St. Étienne, France, 1890-99."@en , "Ribbon made of silk chiné 'Velours au Sabre' decoration. With image of a small 'island' of grass against a background of flowering plants in shades of pink, green-grey and some pale yellow on a white ground. Standing on the 'island' are two exotic birds, one with pink legs and blue tail-feathers, the other with buff coloured legs and pink tail-feathers. Other colours used are shades of brown, yellow, black and green-grey. Part of the design is in simple silk chiné satin, but in places the satin has been cut to form a pile, thus giving depth to the design."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/78a55c54-a8e5-3632-ba0c-8b1bd5c1151a/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/78a55c54-a8e5-3632-ba0c-8b1bd5c1151a/dimension/2> ;
